*.pyc

# Node (local runtime only, for `node --test` -- not part of the site or its
# build; downloaded from nodejs.org, extracted here rather than installed
# system-wide, so it stays out of version control)
.node-runtime/

# GitHub CLI (local install only, so Claude can read/act on Issues and PRs
# without a global apt package or sudo -- downloaded from cli.github.com's
# GitHub releases, extracted here, not part of the site or its build)
.gh-runtime/

